{"heroId":63,"art":{"card":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/vampirebat_card.webp","background":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/backgrounds/mina_bg.webp","vertical":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/vampirebat_vertical.webp"},"text":{"en":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"Mina Ha had it all...rich parents, elite education, and an arranged marriage that would see her ascend from run-of-the-mill upper class to American royalty.  She was happy.\n\nThen her betrothed was assassinated.\n\nMina wept; not for the life of her fiancé, but for the future that was stolen from her.  Why couldn’t the killer just wait until after the wedding? Then she’d have the last name she always dreamed of and no one would even have to pretend to love anyone.  It could have been perfect, but life wasn’t fair...and so Mina did what she always does when things don’t go her way: she told her parents to fix it.\n\nMr. And Mrs. Ha knew that the only way to appease their daughter was to offer her something greater than what she lost... and marrying into one of the world’s most lauded families was a tall order to top.  They had to think big.  They had to think outside of the box.  They had to promise their daughter immortality.\n\nIt took a small fortune, but eventually they found a vampire who was willing to turn her.  Unsurprisingly, Mina thought the idea of eternal youth and a trust fund was an acceptable plan B and happily agreed to the proposal.  Now a fledgling vampire, Mina is quickly discovering that the clout she held as a human has no weight in vampire high society...and while at first that annoyed her, if there is one thing Mina has a knack for, it's learning the rules so she can subvert them.  She will be the Viscount of New York, the other vampires just don't know it yet.","tags":["Harasser","Nimble","Vexing"]},"es":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"Mina Ha lo tenía todo… unos padres adinerados, una educación de élite y un matrimonio arreglado que la haría ascender de la alta sociedad corriente a la realeza estadounidense. Era feliz.\n\nHasta que mataron a su prometido.\n\nMina lloró, pero no por él, sino por el futuro que le habían arrebatado. ¿No podía haber esperado el asesino a que se casaran? Así, tendría el apellido que siempre había soñado y nadie tendría que fingir querer a nadie. Podría haber sido perfecto, pero nada lo es en esta vida... Así que Mina hizo lo que hace siempre que las cosas no salen como ella quiere: les pidió a sus padres que lo solucionasen.\n\nEl Sr. y la Sra. Ha sabían que la única forma de contentar a su hija era ofrecerle algo mejor que lo que había perdido... y casarse con el heredero de una de las familias más alabadas del mundo no era fácil de superar. Tenían que pensar a lo grande y ser ocurrentes. Tenían que prometerle ser inmortal.\n\nNo fue nada barato, pero finalmente dieron con un vampiro dispuesto a convertirla. Como era de esperar, a Mina le pareció que la idea de la juventud eterna y un fondo fiduciario eran una opción aceptable, y aceptó felizmente la propuesta. Ahora, como vampira novata, Mina está descubriendo rápidamente que la influencia que tenía como humana no sirve de nada en la alta sociedad de los vampiros… y, aunque al principio le molestaba, si hay algo que se le da bien a Mina, es aprender las reglas para poder sabotearlas. Será la Vizcondesa de Nueva York, pero los demás vampiros aún no lo saben.","tags":["Atormentadora","Ágil","Irritante"]}},"abilities":{"en":[{"id":193508101,"slot":1,"ultimate":false,"name":"Rake","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/vampirebat/vampirebat_rake.webp","quip":[],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"#ability_vampirebat_steallife_desc"}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Damage","value":"60","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/damage_magic_color.svg"}]},{"label":"On Hero Hit:","stats":[{"